Hi,

I try to use linetype with geom_polygon without success...
Starting with the help example,

ids <- factor(c("1.1", "2.1", "1.2", "2.2", "1.3", "2.3"))
values <- data.frame(id = ids, value = c(3, 3.1, 3.1, 3.2, 3.15, 3.5))
