Hi all,
Regarding italic legend lables: you should be able to use expressions
in legend labels, except there is a bug in the way. See

http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/browse_thread/thread/fe4ed06dd5cb3dac/c8d6d17fcfe8f70c?lnk=raot&pli=1

and

http://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/issues/issue/124

-Ista

