There might be a map of the different symbols somewhere on the internet, but you might be able to figure it out by just swapping the numbers out.

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(2,17))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(1,3))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(4, 5))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(6, 7))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(8, 9))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(10, 11))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(12, 13))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(14, 15))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(16, 18))

G + scale_shape_manual(values=c(19, 20))

There might be more... and there's probably a better way.

